    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "annot-portal-e2e3-20260718-e4",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 2304,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "AS-BUILT E4 2026-07-18 (insolv\u00eancia watcher, mega-run 20260717-190134): NEW satellite collection citius_watches on the usr.<owner> spine - row {processoId, subjects[] (NIFs/names), lastSeen, seenRefs[]} (ordinary dossi\u00ea data, no secrets). pollInsolvencyWatches(app,processoId,actor,deps) fetches the Citius publico insolvencia list (SSRF-guarded, config base URL) for the watched subjects, diffs vs seenRefs, and for each NEW publication emits a PortalEvent kind watch.hit via attachPortalEvent + advances seenRefs (idempotent: a seen ref never re-emits). No scheduler wired (public-tier has no cron); operator/cron calls the fn, POST /api/legal/portal/insolvency/poll (requireLegalSuiteApp tier) runs one cycle for a dossi\u00ea. Org-checked; audit rows refs-only.",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT E4 2026-07-18 (insolv\u00eancia watcher, mega-run 20260717-190134): NEW satellite collection citius_watches on the usr.<owner> spine - row {processoId, subjects[] (NIFs/names), lastSeen, seenRefs[]} (ordinary dossi\u00ea data, no secrets). pollInsolvencyWatches(app,processoId,actor,deps) fetches the Citius publico insolvencia list (SSRF-guarded, config base URL) for the watched subjects, diffs vs seenRefs, and for each NEW publication emits a PortalEvent kind watch.hit via attachPortalEvent + advances seenRefs (idempotent: a seen ref never re-emits). No scheduler wired (public-tier has no cron); operator/cron calls the fn, POST /api/legal/portal/insolvency/poll (requireLegalSuiteApp tier) runs one cycle for a dossi\u00ea. Org-checked; audit rows refs-only.",
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT E4 2026-07-18 (insolv\u00eancia watcher, mega-run 20260717-190134): NEW satellite collection citius_watches on the usr.<owner> spine - row {processoId, subjects[] (NIFs/names), lastSeen, seenRefs[]} (ordinary dossi\u00ea data, no secrets). pollInsolvencyWatches(app,processoId,actor,deps) fetches the Citius publico insolvencia list (SSRF-guarded, config base URL) for the watched subjects, diffs vs seenRefs, and for each NEW publication emits a PortalEvent kind watch.hit via attachPortalEvent + advances seenRefs (idempotent: a seen ref never re-emits). No scheduler wired (public-tier has no cron); operator/cron calls the fn, POST /api/legal/portal/insolvency/poll (requireLegalSuiteApp tier) runs one cycle for a dossi\u00ea. Org-checked; audit rows refs-only.",
