      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-02 (run 20260801-171149, slice A3) - integration_definitions gains the WRITE path:\nbuilder saves land here PRIVATE-BY-DEFAULT (origin {kind:'authored'}), stamped from the verified actor -\nthe store's create() now REQUIRES the actor (org-congruence enforced; replace re-checks canWriteDefinition\nand judges tier changes by the setVisibility rule). declaredOrigins REMOVED (never read; the one egress\ntruth is action baseUrls at the origin-resolver seam - decisions.md 2026-08-02). The DISK RUNTIME TIER\n(<dataDir>/integrations/runtime/) is FROZEN: imported once at boot as visibility:'global',\norigin {kind:'legacy-runtime', importHash, importedAt} rows under the reserved __legacy_runtime__\nsentinel org/user (hash comparator: unchanged->skip, changed->reported drift, Mongo wins; Rule-10\nreview 2026-08-15). No sync read serves the directory any more; stored SKILL.md bodies are scrubbed\non read (scrubSecretText) before entering agent prompts.",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-02 (run 20260801-171149, slice A3) - integration_definitions gains the WRITE path:\nbuilder saves land here PRIVATE-BY-DEFAULT (origin {kind:'authored'}), stamped from the verified actor -\nthe store's create() now REQUIRES the actor (org-congruence enforced; replace re-checks canWriteDefinition\nand judges tier changes by the setVisibility rule). declaredOrigins REMOVED (never read; the one egress\ntruth is action baseUrls at the origin-resolver seam - decisions.md 2026-08-02). The DISK RUNTIME TIER\n(<dataDir>/integrations/runtime/) is FROZEN: imported once at boot as visibility:'global',\norigin {kind:'legacy-runtime', importHash, importedAt} rows under the reserved __legacy_runtime__\nsentinel org/user (hash comparator: unchanged->skip, changed->reported drift, Mongo wins; Rule-10\nreview 2026-08-15). No sync read serves the directory any more; stored SKILL.md bodies are scrubbed\non read (scrubSecretText) before entering agent prompts.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-02 (run 20260801-171149, slice A3) - integration_definitions gains the WRITE path:\nbuilder saves land here PRIVATE-BY-DEFAULT (origin {kind:'authored'}), stamped from the verified actor -\nthe store's create() now REQUIRES the actor (org-congruence enforced; replace re-checks canWriteDefinition\nand judges tier changes by the setVisibility rule). declaredOrigins REMOVED (never read; the one egress\ntruth is action baseUrls at the origin-resolver seam - decisions.md 2026-08-02). The DISK RUNTIME TIER\n(<dataDir>/integrations/runtime/) is FROZEN: imported once at boot as visibility:'global',\norigin {kind:'legacy-runtime', importHash, importedAt} rows under the reserved __legacy_runtime__\nsentinel org/user (hash comparator: unchanged->skip, changed->reported drift, Mongo wins; Rule-10\nreview 2026-08-15). No sync read serves the directory any more; stored SKILL.md bodies are scrubbed\non read (scrubSecretText) before entering agent prompts.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
