      "updated": 1786748302509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-14 (salomao migration S2+S3, row shapes):\n- triggers: platform-provider rows (microsoft-365 / google-workspace) are stamped\n  kind:'listener' + pollConfig { actionName, intervalMs } AT CREATION (no longer only via\n  explicit input); TriggerCreateRequest carries optional pollIntervalMs (min 1000); the\n  trigger VIEW emits entrypoint (omit-when-absent).\n- artifacts (import): ArtifactBundle carries optional id (prod envelope sourceArtifactId) +\n  slug; importArtifact honours a free bundle.slug (atomic reservation) and adopts bundle.id\n  ONLY under the explicit preserveId request flag (409 on collision, side effects rolled\n  back). Import response carries additive importReport { slug, id, appData } - appData is a\n  per-collection seed report (reserved '__*' / shared 'usr.*' skipped BY NAME; engine\n  importCreate preserves supplied createdAt/updatedAt verbatim, import path only).",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-14 (salomao migration S2+S3, row shapes):\n- triggers: platform-provider rows (microsoft-365 / google-workspace) are stamped\n  kind:'listener' + pollConfig { actionName, intervalMs } AT CREATION (no longer only via\n  explicit input); TriggerCreateRequest carries optional pollIntervalMs (min 1000); the\n  trigger VIEW emits entrypoint (omit-when-absent).\n- artifacts (import): ArtifactBundle carries optional id (prod envelope sourceArtifactId) +\n  slug; importArtifact honours a free bundle.slug (atomic reservation) and adopts bundle.id\n  ONLY under the explicit preserveId request flag (409 on collision, side effects rolled\n  back). Import response carries additive importReport { slug, id, appData } - appData is a\n  per-collection seed report (reserved '__*' / shared 'usr.*' skipped BY NAME; engine\n  importCreate preserves supplied createdAt/updatedAt verbatim, import path only).",
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-14 (salomao migration S2+S3, row shapes):\n- triggers: platform-provider rows (microsoft-365 / google-workspace) are stamped\n  kind:'listener' + pollConfig { actionName, intervalMs } AT CREATION (no longer only via\n  explicit input); TriggerCreateRequest carries optional pollIntervalMs (min 1000); the\n  trigger VIEW emits entrypoint (omit-when-absent).\n- artifacts (import): ArtifactBundle carries optional id (prod envelope sourceArtifactId) +\n  slug; importArtifact honours a free bundle.slug (atomic reservation) and adopts bundle.id\n  ONLY under the explicit preserveId request flag (409 on collision, side effects rolled\n  back). Import response carries additive importReport { slug, id, appData } - appData is a\n  per-collection seed report (reserved '__*' / shared 'usr.*' skipped BY NAME; engine\n  importCreate preserves supplied createdAt/updatedAt verbatim, import path only).",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 202608173,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "annot-schedules-collections-20260817",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
